        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/46a35a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-01-22T09:37:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So my play group has come of the opinion that the best 3 man team is viionary, legacy, and tachyon... As a result when the time came to play against warlord voss on advanced we pulled them out of the running...</p><p>One by one randomly selected teams charged into the ruins of Atlantis... And each of them met with crushing failure (some swifter than others)</p><p>Fixer, fanatic, ra? DEad</p><p>expatriette, tempest, wraith? Closer, but still ddead&nbsp;</p><p>bunker, Hakka, absolute zero? Crushing and horrible defeat as a result of terrible synergy with gene bound guards and environment...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>everyone was dead, the time had come: we needed the dream team. &nbsp; The battle was long, but we not only killed vos, but fed him to the kraken...this has lead me to ask the question:</p><p>What is your favorite 3 man team? &nbsp;Im curious what other destructive combos are lurking</p>",
