        "created_at": "2013-01-22T18:18:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Melonball\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/46a35a/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Melonball:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So my play group has come of the opinion that the best 3 man team is viionary, legacy, and tachyon…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'm surprised to not see Tempest in the group.</p>\n<p>You've got two heroes that are primarily support (Visionary and Legacy) and one that is a slow build (Tachyon). I'm surprised that a group without an immediate heavy hitter has proven to be the best.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
