        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/46a35a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-01-24T03:17:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Tempest is great, but the reason I dig the visionary/tachyon/legacy combo is synergy.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>visionary uses her power to feed tachyon cards and fuel her trash pile, legacy pumps damage so tachyons burst damage wrecks people, and all 3 of the decks deny damage and control the environment.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>as for voss, 2 gene bound guards at jump is a horror show.</p>",
