        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"Melonball\"]\n\nTempest is great, but the reason I dig the visionary/tachyon/legacy combo is synergy.&nbsp;visionary uses her power to feed tachyon cards and fuel her trash pile, legacy pumps damage so tachyons burst damage wrecks people, and all 3 of the decks deny damage and control the environment.&nbsp;as for voss, 2 gene bound guards at jump is a horror show.\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nTwo damange reduction is nasty, for sure, but when you&#39;ve got heroes that can fairly regularly beat it, particularly when boosted by Legacy, it&#39;s not as big of a deal. That&#39;s why the visionary/tachyon/legacy team looks so strange to me. I&#39;m not saying it&#39;s not great! Just that I&#39;m used to thinking in terms of being able to dish out regular amounts of at least medium-sized damage (3-5).\n",
