        "created_at": "2013-01-24T05:15:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Keep in mind that on advanced if two gene bound are in play if you aren't swinging for 4 you aren't doing anything (which supports your damage concerns)...I agree that the trio is atypical, and there may very well be better groups, but it's alarming how well they play nice</p>",
